Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:30:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Add the screen_demo beat and the App Walkthrough template

A hybrid pattern can now carry one screen_demo beat: the tenant's own
screen recording plays under the shared voiceover between the character
intro and closing. It costs no video units, its bound may reach 600s
(rewritten per job from the probed recording), and a new
screen_recording slot declares the upload on the card.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
