Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Write, fit and brand App Walkthrough videos

screenDemo.ts: probe the recording, write the intro/voiceover/closing
from frames (text-only fallback for non-vision models), keep intro and
closing as exactly one narration cue, letterbox the recording without
trimming it, and render the animated brand end card (fade up, logo
scale, slide in). Branding now exposes the brand colour, tagline and
full logo for the card.

