user script, freezes screenDemo on hybridStory and sizes the demo beat
from the recording. The runner writes the script once (persisted for
retries), voices it as one track, lip-syncs only the two character
beats, drops the fitted recording into the demo beat and appends the
end card as a fail-soft finishing pass. New screenDemoVideo kill switch.

